es once their snaps are gone:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prefix-scoped ownership"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": All pending and delivered operations target only the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"pre-delete-\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" prefix (","type":"text"},{"code":"NotificationType.preDelete","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), leaving any other notification","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types intact.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"4-hour grouping & cap"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Active ","type":"text"},{"code":"Storage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rows (","type":"text"},{"code":"expiredAt > now","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") are sorted by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"expiredAt","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ascending and greedily batched into 4-hour windows anchored to each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"group’s earliest expiry. Each group fires 4 hours before that earliest expiry (so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"subsequent captures never delay an earlier snap’s notice), capped at 6 notifications","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per 24 hours.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rebuild triggers & delivered cleanup"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"rebuildSchedule(modelContext:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"photo\/video capture (","type":"text"},{"code":"CameraViewModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), expiry cleanup and manual\/bulk deletes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"DeletionService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), app launch and foregroun